Probably not in full. Our terms say vehicle bookings must be cancelled at least 48 hours before departure for a full refund. Cancelling less than 48 hours before departure is refunded at 50 per cent.

So a cancellation the day before sailing would normally get a 50% refund. Check your sailing time: if it's more than 48 hours away, you'd get a full refund.

Note: changing (rather than cancelling) your sailing is free up to 24 hours before departure.
